# Sparse trees
Output docs/media/sparse.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-sparse; clear; nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/notes.org" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1s
Shift+Tab
Sleep 300ms
Shift+Tab
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>o/ sparse tree` Enter
Show
Type " o/"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "t"
Sleep 1.5s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>o/ sparse tree, by regexp` Enter
Show
Type " o/"
Sleep 800ms
Type "r"
Sleep 600ms
Type "docs"
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <C-c><C-c> clear the highlights` Enter
Show
Ctrl+C Ctrl+C
Sleep 1.2s
Sleep 1.5s
